T={"It sounds so fake":"Ca sonne tellement faux","Is that \"Epitaph of Twilight\"?":"C'est \"l'Epitaphe du Crépuscule\" ?","I read it!":"J'ai lu !","Looking for...":"Je cherche...","Couldn't connect either":"Pas pu me connecter non plus","Extra Ticket":"Billet en trop","I'll give it to you for free":"Je te le donne gratis","I experienced it":"Je l'ai vécu","I experienced it.":"Je l'ai vécu","Today's WEBNEWS":"Les WEBNEWS du jour","Let's calm down":"On se calme","What's going on?":"Qu'est-ce qui se passe ?","Second Net Crisis?":"Deuxième crise du réseau ?","You serious?":"Sérieux ?","Terrorism?!":"Du terrorisme ?!","Of course":"Evidemment","President Coleman's Statement":"Déclaration du président Coleman","Recovered!!!":"Rétabli !!!","RE: Recovered!!!":"RE: Rétabli !!!","From a friend":"D'après un ami",".HACKERS":".HACKERS","Don't quite understand":"Je comprends pas bien","They're too strong!!!":"Ils sont trop forts !!!","It worked!!":"Ca a marché !!","Words for Beginners":"Mots pour débutants","Area Element":"Elément de zone","Area Level Info":"Infos niveau de zone","Good Info":"Bonnes infos","What's a Grunty?":"C'est quoi un Grunty ?","PIG?!":"UN COCHON ?!","Grunty Found!!":"Grunty trouvé !!","Can't find food":"Nourriture introuvable","Where are the Eggs?":"Où sont les oeufs ?","Level went down":"Niveau en baisse","At Night":"La nuit","What if it's cloudy?":"Et par temps couvert ?","I hate Monsieur":"Je déteste Monsieur","Golden Axe":"Hache d'or","Straw Millionaire!":"De troc en troc !","What does a Symbol do?":"A quoi sert un Symbole ?","To the young lady":"A la jeune demoiselle","Old man":"Le vieux","Red Wand":"Bâton rouge","Talking about Twin Blades":"A propos de Lames Jumelles","Crimson Knights":"Chevaliers Pourpres","Announcement":"Annonce","Cat-like Character":"Personnage félin","Welcome to Ver. 2.75":"Bienvenue en Ver. 2.75","Element Tolerance":"Résistance élémentaire","Physical Tolerance":"Résistance physique","Magic Tolerance":"Résistance magique","Cancelling Tolerance":"Annuler une résistance","Elemental Hit":"Coup élémentaire","Items in Treasures":"Objets des coffres"}
